{"id":"W98fb574d8e4bd87339952b9c","zh":"车辆-轨道耦合动力学","en":"","name":"车辆-轨道耦合动力学","language":"zh","domain":"车辆轨道随机动力学","concept_id":null,"families":[],"definition_zh":"研究车辆与轨道相互作用及耦合振动的动力学理论。","definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":"中文关键词为耦合动力学，英文关键词为coupling system，系统与动力学不是同一概念；不能据此合并。","usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"W98fb574d8e4bd87339952b9c","text":"车辆-轨道耦合动力学","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"Sace76ddf877e666caf36","source_id":"P112","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"基于随机分析理论,考虑线路不平顺及系统动力参数的时-空随机演变特性,将车辆-轨道耦合动力学理论与概率密度演化方法结合,提出一种用于线路基础结构伤损识别的概率密度分布演化方法。","citations":[{"source_id":"P112","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"S1332ad12661984e7c054","source_id":"P112","page":6,"page_end":6,"language":"zh","text":"激励源和系统参数确定时,利用车辆-轨道耦合动力学方法能较好计算出线路基础部件伤损时的系统响应形态。","citations":[{"source_id":"P112","page":6,"page_end":6}]},{"id":"S9c41dba378afe938e7c3","source_id":"P114","page":4,"page_end":4,"language":"zh","text":"以轨道不平顺为激振源的车辆-轨道耦合动力学模型在文献[1]中有详细介绍,不再论述。","citations":[{"source_id":"P114","page":4,"page_end":4}]},{"id":"Sa3fe4c2b2224e0fb66df","source_id":"P114","page":4,"page_end":4,"language":"zh","text":"本文将动力计算模型的验证分成两个部分: (1)与车辆-轨道耦合动力学模型 [1]的计算结果进行对比。","citations":[{"source_id":"P114","page":4,"page_end":4}]},{"id":"Sc279b0db4f631f2cc8fc","source_id":"P115","page":3,"page_end":3,"language":"zh","text":"鉴于此,本文进一步以轨道不平顺实测数据和车辆-轨道耦合动力学为基础,从轨道不平顺及其激扰下的系统动力响应概率分布出发,对比分析轨道不平顺概率模型与轨道不平顺随机模型的计算结果,以进一步验证轨道不平顺概率模型的可靠性和高效性,为轨道不平顺随机模拟方法和车辆-轨道系统随机分析、可靠度评估提供可行的技术手段。","citations":[{"source_id":"P115","page":3,"page_end":3}]},{"id":"Sa0240e0b89453f6ff66d","source_id":"P115","page":4,"page_end":4,"language":"zh","text":"基于车辆-轨道耦合动力学理论 [20],采用多刚体动力学方法建立车辆动力学子模型,采用有限元方法建立轨道子模型 [10],并采用新型轮轨空间耦合模型将车辆子系统与轨道子系统衔接 [21],从而建立适合于高速铁路无砟轨道分析的车辆-轨道耦合动力学模型。","citations":[{"source_id":"P115","page":4,"page_end":4}]},{"id":"S6fe03793bbdc084acec8","source_id":"P116","page":4,"page_end":4,"language":"zh","text":"根据车辆-轨道耦合动力学理论 [6],建立车辆-有砟轨道耦合动力模型,仿真计算常见提速客车 [6]在直线轨道和不同轨道谱的最高限制速度下的动力响应, 见表2。","citations":[{"source_id":"P116","page":4,"page_end":4}]},{"id":"S56da223a2cac14acef6e","source_id":"P116","page":6,"page_end":6,"language":"zh","text":"基于此认识,本文将轨道不平顺数据统计和车辆-轨道耦合动力学理论相结合, 计算出了行车速度-动力指标限值联合下的青藏铁路界限谱参数,可为青藏铁路的养护维修提供参考。","citations":[{"source_id":"P116","page":6,"page_end":6}]},{"id":"S8996494b69ef716f3adc","source_id":"P117","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"本文以车辆-轨道耦合动力学为基础,建立此系统的动力分析模型。","citations":[{"source_id":"P117","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"Sd06026093cb8334feb74","source_id":"P117","page":3,"page_end":3,"language":"zh","text":"采用车辆-轨道耦合动力学理论,将车辆结构视为多刚体系统,轨道结构视为弹性基础。","citations":[{"source_id":"P117","page":3,"page_end":3}]},{"id":"S93181b0091e87399ceae","source_id":"P118","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"结合车辆-轨道耦合动力学理论和概率方法,建立考虑车轮踏面磨耗-轨道随机不平顺耦合作用的车辆-轨道随机分析模型,并用一类概率密度演化方程解决模型的概率密度传递问题。","citations":[{"source_id":"P118","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"S17f0ef6ec6ab38ab19a3","source_id":"P118","page":4,"page_end":4,"language":"zh","text":"在确定性计算中,基于车辆-轨道耦合动力学模型 [19],可算出在轨道不平顺和车轮踏面磨耗型面下的车辆、轨道系统动力响应时程。","citations":[{"source_id":"P118","page":4,"page_end":4}]},{"id":"S2abf3fe5c63028d31170","source_id":"P131","page":4,"page_end":4,"language":"zh","text":"基于车辆-轨道耦合动力学模型 [24],可以开展轨道随机不平顺作用下的动力极值计算;而轨道不平顺概率模型能遍历随机不平顺不同类型间的幅值-波长组合,其给出的概率信息能用于可靠度分析。","citations":[{"source_id":"P131","page":4,"page_end":4}]},{"id":"Sfbcfd1f7f99a1f899170","source_id":"P131","page":6,"page_end":6,"language":"zh","text":"基于车辆-轨道耦合动力学模型,可以算出不同类型累计概率谱联合时的动力响应极值,即获得式(11)的结果。","citations":[{"source_id":"P131","page":6,"page_end":6}]}],"sources":{"P112":{"id":"P112","title":"用于铁路线路基础结构伤损识别的概率密度分布演化方法","authors":"徐磊,翟婉明,陈宪麦,陶伟峰","year":"2018","doi":"10.3969/j.issn.1001-8360.2018.12.014","journal_citation":"铁道学报","label":"徐磊等（2018）","overview_slug":"2018-probability-density-distribution-evolution-method-for-damage-detection-of-railway-infrastructure"},"P114":{"id":"P114","title":"车辆-轨道系统激振源随机分析","authors":"徐磊,陈宪麦","year":"2018","doi":"10.3969/j.issn.1001-8360.2018.04.017","journal_citation":"铁道学报","label":"徐磊等（2018）","overview_slug":"2018-random-analysis-on-vibration-sources-of-train-track-system"},"P115":{"id":"P115","title":"轨道不平顺概率模型","authors":"徐磊,翟婉明","year":"2018","doi":"10.19818/j.cnki.1671-1637.2018.03.006","journal_citation":"交通运输工程学报","label":"徐磊等（2018）","overview_slug":"2018-track-irregularity-probabilistic-model"},"P116":{"id":"P116","title":"青藏铁路轨道不平顺界限谱研究","authors":"徐磊,翟婉明,陈宪麦,高建敏","year":"2018","doi":"10.3969/j.issn.1001-8360.2018.05.015","journal_citation":"铁道学报","label":"徐磊等（2018）","overview_slug":"2018-research-on-track-irregularity-boundary-psds-of-qinghai-tibet-railway"},"P117":{"id":"P117","title":"用于车辆-轨道系统参数优化的分层设计与权重组合方法","authors":"徐磊,陈宪麦","year":"2019","doi":"10.3969/j.issn.1001-8360.2019.05.022","journal_citation":"铁道学报","label":"徐磊等（2019）","overview_slug":"2019-multi-layer-design-and-weight-method-for-parameter-optimization-of-vehicle-track-system"},"P118":{"id":"P118","title":"车轮踏面磨耗及轨道不平顺联合作用下的车辆-轨道系统随机分析模型","authors":"徐磊,翟婉明","year":"2020","doi":"10.3969/j.issn.1001-8360.2020.02.011","journal_citation":"铁道学报","label":"徐磊等（2020）","overview_slug":"2020-stochastic-analysis-model-for-vehicle-track-coupled-systems-under-joint-random-irregularities-of-whe"},"P131":{"id":"P131","title":"车辆-轨道系统动力极值预测及可靠度计算","authors":"徐磊,朱雪燕,金浩然,刘鹏飞,闫斌,余志武","year":"2024","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.T20231395","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"徐磊等（2024）","overview_slug":"2024-dynamic-extrema-prediction-and-reliability-assessment-of-vehicle-track-coupled-system"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"计算车辆与轨道相互作用，为随机响应分析提供确定性动力基础。","language":"zh","source_id":"P112","paper_slug":"2018-probability-density-distribution-evolution-method-for-damage-detection-of-railway-infrastructure","title":"用于铁路线路基础结构伤损识别的概率密度分布演化方法","kind":"paper_usage"},{"text":"描述车辆与轨道相互作用，是由不平顺计算构架响应的理论基础。","language":"zh","source_id":"P114","paper_slug":"2018-random-analysis-on-vibration-sources-of-train-track-system","title":"车辆－轨道系统激振源随机分析","kind":"paper_usage"},{"text":"联合计算车辆和轨道相互作用，为界限谱提供动力响应约束。","language":"zh","source_id":"P116","paper_slug":"2018-research-on-track-irregularity-boundary-psds-of-qinghai-tibet-railway","title":"青藏铁路轨道不平顺界限谱研究","kind":"paper_usage"},{"text":"通过轮轨相互作用联合求解车辆与轨道的动力响应。","language":"zh","source_id":"P115","paper_slug":"2018-track-irregularity-probabilistic-model","title":"轨道不平顺概率模型","kind":"paper_usage"},{"text":"将车辆与轨道通过轮轨相互作用统一计算的理论基础。","language":"zh","source_id":"P117","paper_slug":"2019-multi-layer-design-and-weight-method-for-parameter-optimization-of-vehicle-track-system","title":"用于车辆-轨道系统参数优化的分层设计与权重组合方法","kind":"paper_usage"},{"text":"通过轮轨相互作用联合计算车辆与轨道振动的理论基础。","language":"zh","source_id":"P118","paper_slug":"2020-stochastic-analysis-model-for-vehicle-track-coupled-systems-under-joint-random-irregularities-of-whe","title":"车轮踏面磨耗及轨道不平顺联合作用下的车辆-轨道系统随机分析模型","kind":"paper_usage"},{"text":"描述车辆与轨道相互作用，用于由不平顺输入计算动力响应。","language":"zh","source_id":"P131","paper_slug":"2024-dynamic-extrema-prediction-and-reliability-assessment-of-vehicle-track-coupled-system","title":"车辆-轨道系统动力极值预测及可靠度计算","kind":"paper_usage"}],"word_links":[{"id":"W596e8c55ce80fbf14ce19f15","name":"vehicle-track coupling dynamics","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null},{"id":"W93fa62740a74797c62091094","name":"vehicle-track coupled dynamics","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null},{"id":"Wf58055b7daded489daf6f08d","name":"vehicle-track coupling system","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"参考译法","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"W596e8c55ce80fbf14ce19f15","name":"vehicle-track coupling dynamics","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null},{"id":"W93fa62740a74797c620